/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Current\040hybrid\055electric\040powertrain\040architectures\072\040Applying\040empirical\040design\040data\040to\040life\040cycle\040assessment\040and\040whole\055life\040cost\040analysis)
/Author (Timothy\040W\040Hutchinson\054\040Stuart\040C\040Burgess\054\040Guido\040Herrmann)
/Subject (The\040recent\040introduction\040of\040hybrid\055electric\040powertrain\040technology\040has\040disrupted\040the\040automotive\040industry\054\040causing\040significant\040powertrain\040design\040divergence\056\040As\040this\040radical\040powertrain\040innovation\040matures\054\040will\040hybrid\040vehicles\040dominate\040the\040future\040automotive\040market\040and\040does\040this\040represent\040a\040positive\040shift\040in\040the\040environmental\040impact\040of\040the\040industry\077\040The\040answer\040to\040this\040question\040is\040sought\040within\040this\040paper\056\040It\040seeks\040to\040take\040advantage\040of\040the\040position\040that\040the\040industry\040has\040reached\054\040replacing\040previous\040theoretical\040studies\040with\040the\040first\040extensive\040empirical\040models\040of\040life\040cycle\040emissions\040and\040whole\055life\040costing\056\040A\040comprehensive\040snapshot\040of\040today\220s\040hybrid\040market\040is\040presented\054\040with\040detailed\040descriptions\040of\040the\040various\040hybrid\040powertrain\040architectures\056\040Design\040data\040has\040been\040gathered\040for\04044\040hybrid\040passenger\040cars\040currently\040available\040in\040the\040US\056\040The\040empirical\040data\040is\040used\040to\040explore\040the\040relative\040life\040cycle\040greenhouse\040gas\040emissions\040and\040whole\055life\040costing\040of\040different\040hybrid\040powertrain\040architectures\056\040Potential\040dominant\040designs\040are\040identified\040and\040their\040emissions\040are\040shown\040to\040be\040reduced\056\040However\054\040both\040the\040emissions\040and\040economic\040competitiveness\040of\040different\040hybrid\040powertrains\040are\040shown\040to\040vary\040significantly\040depending\040on\040how\040the\040vehicle\040is\040used\056)
/Keywords (29\040Jan\0402014\054\040Applied\040Energy\054\040Powertrain\054\040Automotive\040industry\054\040Life\055cycle\040assessment\054\040University\040of\040Bristol)
